# 12.2-utility-syntax-guidelines.cov - XBD 12.2 Utility Syntax Guidelines.
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.
#
# The guidelines are requirements ("as if shall") on the standard utilities
# that claim conformance in their OPTIONS section. They are checked through a
# representative set of those utilities; each utility module tests its own
# options.

